OL,3,GNEWSATube upholstery is Mastermind
OL,4,Aspecialist subject
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who competed on Mastermind with
OL,7,FTransport for London's (TfL) patterned
OL,8,Fupholstery as her specialist subject
OL,9,Fhas said she is glad to see more people
OL,10,Fappreciating "beautiful design in
OL,11,Fpublic life".
OL,13,FEmily Medhurst said she chose to
OL,14,Fspecialise in London's moquette, a
OL,15,Fdurable, woollen seating material that
OL,16,Fis used in upholstery on public
OL,17,Ftransport across the world, as she grew
OL,18,Fup in the capital and had "always been
OL,19,Finterested in textiles and design".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
