OL,3,GNEWSATube upholstery is Mastermind
OL,4,Aspecialist subject
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe appeared on the BBC quiz show
OL,7,Fwearing a vest that she had knitted
OL,8,Fthat featured the London Overground
OL,9,Fmoquette designed by Wallace Sewell.
OL,11,FMedhurst scored eight points on her
OL,12,Fchosen subject and came third during
OL,13,Fthe episode of Mastermind.
